TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-1704.02352v2
AU  - ˛EGA, MACIEJ DOŁ
AU  - ŚNIADY, PIOTR
TI  - GAUSSIAN FLUCTUATIONS OF JACK-DEFORMED RANDOM YOUNG DIAGRAMS
DA  - D:20181109
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/1704.02352
AB  - We introduce a large class of random Young diagrams which can be regarded as a natural one-parameter deformation of some classi- cal Young diagram ensembles; a deformation which is related to Jack polynomials and Jack characters. We show that each such a random Young diagram converges asymptotically to some limit shape and that the ﬂuctuations around the limit are asymptotically Gaussian.
ER  - 
